"says whether a signal here has a historical track record — it corrects nothing and changes no "
"count. Read it as the generous measure: a correlation grades how well the model ranked wet and "
"dry years, which is an easier test than whether its stated probabilities verify. A region can "
"correlate respectably and still add little over guessing."
